% Scenario: text under a clip and colour. The clip opens a save, the
% colour is set before the run, then the text operation, and nothing
% else.
/Helvetica findfont 12 scalefont setfont
0 0 200 200 rectclip
1 0 0 setrgbcolor
50 50 moveto (Hi) show
showpage
